# Google Maps Embed API key, used by both maps: the work area on the home page
# and the city on a location page.
# Make one at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis, enable
# "Maps Embed API", and restrict the key to the studiekeuzeadvies.nl domain.
#
# Without this key both maps fall back to an old keyless endpoint that Google
# does not support. That is fine while you build. It is not fine when you launch.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_EMBED_KEY=
